OL,3,GNEWSAContractor accused of hiding
OL,4,Aevidence is fined
OL,5,
OL,6,FA construction company being
OL,7,Finvestigated by the UK's competition
OL,8,Fwatchdog over suspected bid-rigging on
OL,9,Fcontracts for school repairs has been
OL,10,Ffined.
OL,12,FIn June, Bedfordshire-based M&J Group
OL,13,F(Construction & Roofing) Ltd was named
OL,14,Fby the Competition and Markets
OL,15,FAuthority (CMA) alongside 11 other
OL,16,Ffirms as part of an ongoing inquiry.
OL,18,FThe CMA said the company attempted to
OL,19,Fconceal mobile phones and documents
OL,20,Fduring an inspection in December 2024,
OL,21,Fbreaching its "clear instructions".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
